{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_012aughszg9FvKT66UPmqNeP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Reboot issued — this session ends here; the `@reboot` cron resumes the run after the host comes back.\n\n**Session 15 summary:**\n\n**SCST wedge recurred and is the immediate blocker.** During `zero_silent_loss` iter 2, the host's SCST target wedged again (2 D-state `iscsi_conn_cleanup` threads, 33 `EXEC_CHECK_BLOCKING`) — all 15 joins failed. Only a host reboot clears it, which is now in progress with the recovery cron re-armed.\n\n**Three structural fixes landed to stop the recurrence (v0.4.11):**\n1. `tools/mkfs_mxfs.c` — BLKZEROOUT now issued in 4MB chunks instead of one 33MB WRITE SAME, so no single strictly-serialized SCST command can starve past the 60s initiator timeout (the proven wedge trigger). Rebuilt.\n2. Workload script — pre-mkfs barrier verifying every node is really umounted+rmmod'd before the slot table gets zeroed (mkfs racing live CAW heartbeat was the likely trigger condition), plus numeric sanitization fixing the `find: unbound variable` crash that produced `fs_silent=999999`.\n3. `cluster_reset_n.sh` — hard-fails if the local srcversion is unreadable (it had reported a false `ALL_OK` against 16 unreachable nodes).\n\n**New bug class identified: `silent=1`.** One of 1600 dirents was missing both before and after drop_caches, with zero P108/HOLE/shutdown signatures — quieter than every previously fixed loss mode, ~1 iter in 6. It can't be diagnosed post-hoc (the next iter re-mkfs's the device), so the workload script now self-diagnoses at failure time: per-node mkdir/touch error capture, missing-name enumeration, and creator-view probes while the FS is still mounted. All-16 dmesg from the failing window is preserved in the run dir.\n\n**Next session:** recreate `/tmp/.mxfs_pass`, `cluster_reset_n.sh 16`, re-run `zero_silent_loss` (480s budget) — a failing iter will now name the missing dirent and whether its create errored or vanished. Criteria not met; marker not written."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":219,"cache_read_input_tokens":117030,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":219},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cd05e5a4-1bae-4b40-b8b4-ee58800ac150","uuid":"8fe5ad56-1dee-4d20-a134-5c81e314ea83","request_id":"req_011Cbvo4ZQ2tjjoYfByfUK3P"}
